**Serplora Academy** is an initiative created by a small group of developers from different countries. Despite our diverse backgrounds, we shared a common frustration: high-quality programming resources were either too expensive or overly simplistic.

To address this, we built a platform where learners can study programming in a structured way and run code directly.

Serplora follows a **freemium model**. Core learning resources and coding tools are available for free, while advanced features may be offered as part of paid plans to support the platform.

Every resource published on Serplora is carefully reviewed to ensure accuracy and practical relevance.

We hope you find this platform valuable in your learning journey.
